WEBVTT

00:10:27.581 --> 00:10:30.751
I was doing this every day to make sure

00:10:30.793 --> 00:10:33.837
that this big moment
that it was leading up to,

00:10:33.879 --> 00:10:37.091
that would change the entire world,
would go perfectly.

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.177
But that didn't happen.

00:10:40.219 --> 00:10:44.098
I did not meet the expectations
that I had set for myself,

00:10:44.139 --> 00:10:45.599
that the world had set for me.

00:10:46.475 --> 00:10:48.977
And this is the first time
as a major artist

00:10:48.977 --> 00:10:51.480
that I had received
mixed reviews of my art.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.440
And again, it broke me down, man.

00:10:54.525 --> 00:10:56.318
I became unmotivated,

00:10:56.318 --> 00:10:59.530
I started overindulging in things
that I'm not proud of.